_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8wO2EaONgNH30s-Bg15x2q1CumYWqKCvVr2RgQj56TUg&oe=6A2D47B6"}, {"file_name": "1 trex troca.png", "id": "1330523669102972", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1330523672436305_9000464861639034881_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HJI3M6crL-UQ7kNvwEct03Q&_nc_oc=Adqaj8YyvThzCjzBS5HIcRscTURhX0KJCFUAHKAuIewNNlifbfu8ORt9vcZbO6ts_x4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9kHsGNQEKsUvM-_v4AHsnZ8KaB522hKX_8MPbd_KPNQQ&oe=6A2D69CC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "dino_Comme_2560x1440 best.png", "id": "1390044829484265", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1390044832817598_7314245579331429285_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FURnLW-IPxgQ7kNvwH67gVC&_nc_oc=AdonxAnpZinkyuylDJNGlF8OEzpwhqACJQjVzXMnwK1eyXQVvOfxPGjG0n4Ihf9CjkE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8DJVeoKCuYalOhk-ZzSTgvbCSjDpDEkVHEo-I1ZyfYLA&oe=6A2D5F35"}, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "keywords": ["puzzle", "education", "dinosaur", "prehistoric", "trex"], "long_description": "# **Bring dinosaurs back to life in your own space. \ud83e\udd96**\nAssemble giant skeletons **bone by bone** in a hands-on mixed-reality puzzle featuring **dinosaurs and other prehistoric creatures.**\n\nBegin with **5 iconic species** and grow your lab with new discoveries.\n>\n# \ud83e\uddb4 Turn your room into a dinosaur lab.\n{1988424452556026}\nRebuild prehistoric giants **bone by bone** in mixed reality.\n\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udccf Life-Size Dinosaur Reveal\n{2799642560387035}\nOnce completed, watch them appear at **full, life-size scale** in your own environment.\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udca1Multiple Difficulty Levels\n\n{2144406449672040}\n\nEach species includes **three levels of complexity**, letting you choose between a more accessible puzzle or a deeper reconstruction challenge.\n\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udde0 Learn as You Build\n\n{1381198063762243}\n\nAs each bone finds its place, **scientific insights appear**, revealing how dinosaur skeletons were structured and discovered.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd95 Start with 5 Species\nStart with **5 iconic prehistoric giants** including **Tyrannosaurus Rex and Pteranodon.**\n\nNew creature packs will expand the lab with **more species and discoveries.**\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udcac Join our Discord \nFollow upcoming dinosaurs, share feedback, and connect with other players.\n\n**\ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/PW2Qwavp4d**\n", "short_description": "Bring prehistoric giants back to life in your room. \ud83e\udd96\nAssemble giant skeletons bone by bone in a hands-on mixed-reality puzzle featuring dinosaurs and other prehistoric creatures.\nBegin with 5 iconic species and grow your lab with new discoveries."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1308867281428349", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "keywords": ["\u62fc\u56fe", "\u6559\u80b2", "\u6050\u9f99", "\u53f2\u524d", "\u9738\u738b\u9f99"], "long_description": "# **\u8ba9\u6050\u9f99\u5728\u4f60\u7684\u7a7a\u95f4\u91cc\u91cd\u751f\u3002\ud83e\udd96**\n\u8ba9\u53f2\u524d\u5de8\u517d\u5728\u4f60\u7684\u7a7a\u95f4\u91cc\u91cd\u751f\u3002\u5728\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6df7\u5408\u73b0\u5b9e\u62fc\u56fe\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\uff0c**\u4e00\u5757\u4e00\u5757**\u5730\u62fc\u7ec4\u5de8\u578b\u9aa8\u67b6\uff0c\u63a2\u7d22**\u6050\u9f99\u4e0e\u5176\u4ed6\u53f2\u524d\u751f\u7269\u3002**\n\u4ece**5\u79cd\u6807\u5fd7\u6027\u7269\u79cd**\u5f00\u59cb\uff0c\u7528\u65b0\u53d1\u73b0\u4e0d\u65ad\u58ee\u5927\u4f60\u7684\u5b9e\u9a8c\u5ba4\u3002\n>\n# \ud83e\uddb4 \u628a\u4f60\u7684\u623f\u95f4\u53d8\u6210\u6050\u9f99\u5b9e\u9a8c\u5ba4\u3002\n{2173417273477135}\n\u5728\u6df7\u5408\u73b0\u5b9e\u4e2d**\u4e00\u5757\u4e00\u5757**\u5730\u91cd\u5efa\u53f2\u524d\u5de8\u517d\u3002\n>\n# \ud83d\udccf \u771f\u5b9e\u6bd4\u4f8b\u6050\u9f99\u5448\u73b0\n{2387477348438768}\n\u62fc\u88c5\u5b8c\u6210\u540e\uff0c\u770b\u5b83\u4eec\u4ee5**\u771f\u5b9e\u7684\u5b8c\u6574\u6bd4\u4f8b**\u51fa\u73b0\u5728\u4f60\u7684\u7a7a\u95f4\u91cc\u3002\n>\n# \ud83d\udca1\u591a\u79cd\u96be\u5ea6\u7b49\u7ea7\n{1549919106109076}\n\u6bcf\u4e2a\u7269\u79cd\u5305\u542b**\u4e09\u4e2a\u590d\u6742\u5ea6\u7b49\u7ea7**\uff0c\u8ba9\u4f60\u5728\u8f7b\u677e\u62fc\u56fe\u4e0e\u6df1\u5ea6\u91cd\u5efa\u6311\u6218\u4e4b\u95f4\u81ea\u7531\u9009\u62e9\u3002\n>\n# \ud83e\udde0 \u8fb9\u62fc\u8fb9\u5b66\n{812875391246406}\n\u6bcf\u5f53\u4e00\u5757\u9aa8\u5934\u5f52\u4f4d\uff0c**\u79d1\u5b66\u77e5\u8bc6\u968f\u4e4b\u5448\u73b0**\uff0c\u63ed\u793a\u6050\u9f99\u9aa8\u67b6\u7684\u7ed3\u6784\u4e0e\u53d1\u73b0\u5386\u7a0b\u3002\n>\n# \ud83e\udd95 \u4ece5\u4e2a\u7269\u79cd\u5f00\u59cb\n\u4ece**5\u79cd\u6807\u5fd7\u6027\u53f2\u524d\u5de8\u517d**\u5f00\u59cb\uff0c\u5305\u62ec**\u9738\u738b\u9f99\u548c\u7ffc\u624b\u9f99\u3002**\n\u5168\u65b0\u751f\u7269\u5305\u5c06\u4e3a\u4f60\u7684\u5b9e\u9a8c\u5ba4\u5e26\u6765**\u66f4\u591a\u7269\u79cd\u4e0e\u53d1\u73b0\u3002**\n>\n# \ud83d\udcac \u52a0\u5165\u6211\u4eec\u7684Discord\n\u5173\u6ce8\u5373\u5c06\u4e0a\u7ebf\u7684\u6050\u9f99\uff0c\u5206\u4eab\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u9988\uff0c\u4e0e\u5176\u4ed6\u73a9\u5bb6\u4e92\u52a8\u4ea4\u6d41\u3002\n\n**\ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/PW2Qwavp4d**\n", "short_description": "\u8ba9\u53f2\u524d\u5de8\u517d\u5728\u4f60\u7684\u623f\u95f4\u91cc\u91cd\u751f\u3002\ud83e\udd96 \u5728\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6df7\u5408\u73b0\u5b9e\u62fc\u56fe\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\uff0c\u4e00\u5757\u4e00\u5757\u5730\u62fc\u7ec4\u5de8\u578b\u9aa8\u67b6\uff0c\u63a2\u7d22\u6050\u9f99\u4e0e\u5176\u4ed6\u53f2\u524d\u751f\u7269\u7684\u4e16\u754c\u3002\u4ece5\u79cd\u6807\u5fd7\u6027\u7269\u79cd\u5f00\u59cb\uff0c\u7528\u65b0\u53d1\u73b0\u4e0d\u65ad\u58ee\u5927\u4f60\u7684\u5b9e\u9a8c\u5ba4\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "995967416341839", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "keywords": ["rompecabezas", "educaci\u00f3n", "dinosaurio", "prehist\u00f3rico", "realidadmixta"], "long_description": "# Devuelve la vida a los dinosaurios en tu sal\u00f3n. \ud83e\udd96\n\nEnsambla esqueletos gigantes **hueso por hueso** en un puzzle interactivo de realidad mixta con **dinosaurios y otras criaturas prehist\u00f3ricas.**\n\nCrea tu laboratorio con **5 especies ic\u00f3nicas** y ampl\u00edalo con nuevos descubrimientos.\n>\n# \ud83e\uddb4 Convierte tu sal\u00f3n en un laboratorio de dinosaurios\n{26285219827736399}\nReconstruye gigantes prehist\u00f3ricos **hueso por hueso** en realidad mixta.\n>\n# \ud83d\udccf Dinosaurios a tama\u00f1o real\n{1391472875491115}\nUna vez completados, m\u00edralos aparecer **a escala real** en tu sal\u00f3n.\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udca1M\u00faltiples niveles de dificultad\n{1361957705620129}\nCada especie incluye **tres niveles de complejidad**, permiti\u00e9ndote elegir entre un puzzle accesible y un desaf\u00edo de reconstrucci\u00f3n.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udde0 Aprende construyendo\n{2123306585096587}\nA medida que construyes, **se revela progresivamente informaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica**.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd95 Comienza con 5 especies\n\nComienza con **5 gigantes prehist\u00f3ricos ic\u00f3nicos**, incluyendo **Tyrannosaurus Rex y Pteranodon.**\n\nNuevos paquetes de criaturas ampliar\u00e1n tu laboratorio con ***m\u00e1s especies y descubrimientos.**\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udcac \u00danete a nuestro Discord \n\nSigue los pr\u00f3ximos dinosaurios, comparte tus comentarios y conecta con otros jugadores.\n\n**\ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/PW2Qwavp4d**", "short_description": "Devuelve la vida a los dinosaurios en tu sal\u00f3n. \ud83e\udd96\nEnsambla esqueletos gigantes hueso por hueso en un puzzle interactivo de realidad mixta con dinosaurios y otras criaturas prehist\u00f3ricas.\nCrea tu laboratorio con 5 especies ic\u00f3nicas y ampl\u00edalo con nuevos descubrimientos."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "987587753655740", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "keywords": ["puzzle", "\u00e9ducation", "dinosaure", "pr\u00e9historique", "trex"], "long_description": "# Fais revivre les g\u00e9ants pr\u00e9historiques dans ton salon. \ud83e\udd96\n\nConstruis leur squelette **os par os** dans un puzzle en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte, mettant en sc\u00e8ne des **dinosaures et d\u2019autres cr\u00e9atures pr\u00e9historiques.**\n\nCr\u00e9\u00e9 ton laboratoire avec **5 esp\u00e8ces embl\u00e9matiques** et d\u00e9veloppe le avec de nouvelles d\u00e9couvertes.\n>\n# \ud83e\uddb4 Transforme ton salon en laboratoire de dinosaures\n\n{2710108072679241}\nReconstitue les g\u00e9ants pr\u00e9historiques **os par os** en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte.\n>\n# \ud83d\udccf Apparition des dinosaures \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle\n{879657754907739}\nUne fois termin\u00e9s, observe-les appara\u00eetre \u00e0 **leur taille originelle** dans ton salon.\n>\n# \ud83d\udca1Plusieurs niveaux de difficult\u00e9\n{753683057804883}\nChaque esp\u00e8ce propose **trois niveaux de complexit\u00e9**, te permettant de choisir entre un puzzle accessible et un d\u00e9fi de reconstruction.\n>\n# \ud83e\udde0 Apprends en construisant\n{1453182963109643}\nAu fur et \u00e0 mesure que tu le construis, **des informations scientifiques sont r\u00e9v\u00e9l\u00e9es**.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd95 Commencez avec 5 esp\u00e8ces\nCommence avec **5 g\u00e9ants pr\u00e9historiques embl\u00e9matiques**, dont le **Tyrannosaurus Rex et le Pt\u00e9ranodon.**\n\nDe nouveaux packs de cr\u00e9atures viendront enrichir ton laboratoire avec **davantage d\u2019esp\u00e8ces et de d\u00e9couvertes.**\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udcac Rejoins notre Discord\nSuis les prochains dinosaures, partage tes retours et \u00e9change avec la communaut\u00e9.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 **discord.gg/PW2Qwavp4d**\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Fais revivre les g\u00e9ants pr\u00e9historiques dans ton salon. \ud83e\udd96\nConstruis leur squelette os par os dans un puzzle en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte, mettant en sc\u00e8ne des dinosaures et d\u2019autres cr\u00e9atures pr\u00e9historiques.\nCr\u00e9\u00e9 ton laboratoire avec 5 esp\u00e8ces embl\u00e9matiques et d\u00e9veloppe le avec de nouvelles d\u00e9couvertes \u00e0 venir."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.realcast.io/legal/privacy-policy-2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Realcast Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://realcast.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "es", "de", "zh_CN", "ja", "ko", "it"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26872046075738373"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673607600_954682830806092_2742960029974504043_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8E18wZXx3NQQ7kNvwFrCh5D&_nc_oc=AdpF_9fZ57AQm-voSQmK-GBcD-wubpwjJ5EWhrYgXQc0TSNDhSMDGVQ3BvCTV8CPnf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_whgHRGl3YccOqDik2mXVoZPI1FcOYW87oeLxiNBjc9g&oe=6A2D7311"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"co